 "_about": "Golden weapons, release 1 (2026-10-21, srp-026g/docs/notes/golden_weapons.md). The owner: \"remove modifiers except for silver from all premium weapons\" and make them \"upgradable just like any other weapon but with the first golden bonus already set\"; \"modifications on premium weapons can be rolled too (even silver)\"; the MP7 special joins them. The 22 golden weapons (the 20 wpn_*_premium copies and the Neostead, every weapon whose first default modification is 1230, +10 % silver; and the MP7 special, whose one default is 2004) lose every default modification (1230 included: srp gives each golden weapon 1230 as a modification of its own, the first, so it counts for the rank and can be rerolled; the client never offers a default for a reroll) and base_rarity_level 3 -> 0 (the plain weapons' value: the lobby's rank is min(3, base_rarity_level + modifications), so a base of 3 forbade every craft). Not changed: the VSSK camo (2054 2074 2094, not premium) and the four premium armour pieces.",
